        },
        "stem": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> is present in the gut (intestines) of young mammals.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The diet of young mammals contains lactose which is present in the milk they consume.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Scientists carried out an experiment using <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> with a <i>lac</i> operon (<i>lac</i><sup>+</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i>) and <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> without a <i>lac</i> operon (<i>lac</i><sup>–</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i>).",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The experiment was carried out to determine whether the presence of a <i>lac</i> operon gives <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> a selective advantage.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "Equal numbers of <i>lac</i><sup>+</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> and <i>lac</i><sup>–</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> were given to 8 mice to allow the bacteria to colonise the gut.",
              "On day 0, 50% of the <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> in the gut of each mouse were <i>lac</i><sup>+</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli.</i>",
              "4 mice were fed a standard diet that included lactose.",
              "4 mice were fed a standard diet without lactose.",
              "The percentage of <i>lac</i><sup>+</sup> <i>E.</i> <i>coli</i> that were in the gut of each mouse was determined every day for 6 days."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The results are shown in Fig. 3.2.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "figure",
            "id": "fig3.2",
            "caption": "Fig. 3.2",
            "src": "figures/q3_fig3_2.png",
            "alt": "Effect of diet on bacterial populations",
            "source": {
              "qp": 8
            }
          }
        ],
